  <diagnostics>
    • Heteroskedasticity: use vce(robust) or vce(cluster unit); consider estat hettest; compare SEs.  
    • Serial correlation: for panels, cluster at the treatment unit; for TS, Newey‑West.  
    • Multicollinearity: estat vif; interpret with care, don’t auto‑drop unless necessary.  
    • Influence: lvr2plot, dfbeta, cooksd; check leverage points.  
    • Functional form: linktest, ovtest; inspect residual plots.
  </diagnostics>

